{
  "openapi" : "3.0.3",
  "info" : {
    "title" : "Forcelink Partner Integration API - Momentum Dashboard POC",
    "version" : "1",
    "description" : "Scoped, read-only partner API surface prepared for the Momentum dashboard proof-of-concept, covering time & attendance, proof-of-service (completed work orders), and stock management only.\n\n## Scope notes (per use-case responses received 2026-09-10)\n\n- **Time & attendance**: clock in/out timestamps, late/absent flag, and leave status only, at employee-id + site (org unit) granularity, per shift/day. No real-time/live status in this POC.\n- **Proof of service**: completed work orders only, grouped by site. SLA status/breach-flag calculation is explicitly out of scope for this exercise and will be specified at a later stage - this surface returns raw work-order and timestamp data only.\n- **Stock management**: on-hand quantities and stock movements/transactions, grouped by store, with both current and historical data. Reorder thresholds are not included.\n\n## Auth\n\nAPI-key auth via the `X-Api-Key` header (see `apiKeyAuth` security scheme). A dedicated UAT key, scoped to read-only access and to the specific sites agreed with Momentum, will be issued separately once this spec is confirmed.\n\n## Pagination\n\nAll endpoints here return list payloads and are paginated via `page` / `per_page` query parameters, consistent with the core API.",
    "contact" : {
      "name" : "Acumen Software - Forcelink integrations",
      "email" : "support@acumensoft.net"
    }
  },
  "servers" : [ {
    "description" : "SwaggerHub API Auto Mocking",
    "url" : "https://virtserver.swaggerhub.com/acumensoftware/forcelink-partner-integration-api/1"
  } ],
  "security" : [ {
    "apiKeyAuth" : [ ]
  }, {
    "bearerAuth" : [ ]
  } ],
  "tags" : [ {
    "name" : "Attendance",
    "description" : "Time & attendance shift records."
  }, {
    "name" : "ServiceProof",
    "description" : "Proof-of-service: completed work orders, by site."
  }, {
    "name" : "Stock",
    "description" : "On-hand stock levels and stock movements, by store."
  } ],
  "paths" : {
    "/attendance/shift-records" : {
      "get" : {
        "operationId" : "Attendance_getShiftRecords",
        "tags" : [ "Attendance" ],
        "summary" : "Per-shift attendance records for a date range.",
        "description" : "Returns one record per employee per shift/day within the requested range: clock in/out timestamps, a derived late/absent flag, and leave status. Grouped by `employeeId` + `orgUnit` (site) as agreed with Momentum. No real-time/live status - this is a per-shift/day batch view.",
        "parameters" : [ {
          "name" : "dateFrom",
          "in" : "query",
          "required" : true,
          "description" : "Inclusive start of the date range (ISO-8601 date, `YYYY-MM-DD`).",
          "schema" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "format" : "date"
          },
          "example" : "2026-09-01"
        }, {
          "name" : "dateTo",
          "in" : "query",
          "required" : true,
          "description" : "Inclusive end of the date range (ISO-8601 date, `YYYY-MM-DD`). Maximum span per request is 92 days.",
          "schema" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "format" : "date"
          },
          "example" : "2026-09-30"
        }, {
          "name" : "orgUnitId",
          "in" : "query",
          "required" : false,
          "description" : "Filter to a single site. `orgUnit.type` is `SITE` for every value this endpoint accepts; omit to return all sites the API key is scoped to.",
          "schema" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "format" : "int64"
          },
          "example" : 4021
        }, {
          "name" : "employeeId",
          "in" : "query",
          "required" : false,
          "description" : "Filter to a single employee/resource. Omit to return all employees at the requested site(s).",
          "schema" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "format" : "int64"
          },
          "example" : 88213
        }, {
          "$ref" : "#/components/parameters/Page"
        }, {
          "$ref" : "#/components/parameters/PerPage"
        } ],
        "responses" : {
          "200" : {
            "description" : "Page of shift-attendance records.",
            "headers" : {
              "X-Request-Id" : {
                "$ref" : "#/components/headers/RequestIdHeader"
              }
            },
            "content" : {
              "application/json" : {
                "schema" : {
                  "allOf" : [ {
                    "$ref" : "#/components/schemas/ApiEnvelopeBase"
                  }, {
                    "type" : "object",
                    "required" : [ "success", "data" ],
                    "properties" : {
                      "success" : {
                        "type" : "boolean",
                        "enum" : [ true ]
                      },
                      "data" : {
                        "type" : "array",
                        "items" : {
                          "$ref" : "#/components/schemas/ShiftAttendanceRecord"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  } ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400" : {
            "$ref" : "#/components/responses/ValidationError"
          },
          "401" : {
            "$ref" : "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403" : {
            "$ref" : "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "429" : {
            "$ref" : "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          },
          "500" : {
            "$ref" : "#/components/responses/InternalError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
